Files: power_rates_data.inc
Copyright: U.S. Energy Information Administration (U.S. state average prices);
 Eurostat (European household prices); Ofgem (Great Britain price cap figures);
 Ember (grid CO2 intensity) - figures as published, with the code around them by Eugene Flanagin
License: public-domain and Eurostat-reuse and Ofgem-published and CC-BY-4.0 and GPL-2+
Comment: Each figure comes from one source: the U.S. prices from EIA (public domain), the European
 prices from Eurostat, the GB price cap from Ofgem, the CO2 intensities from Ember (CC BY 4.0). The
 sources and dates are listed at the top of the file, in CREDITS.md and in the user guide,
 "Power & cost". The C code itself is GPL-2+.

